"""Linux-host installer and guarded read-only tools for Fedora on SM-X810.

The guided installer validates a versioned clean-install bundle, requires an
unlocked/rooted Android preflight followed by manual TWRP entry, backs up GPT
metadata and the current boot set, and presents destructive actions for
explicit confirmation. It never writes vbmeta/recovery or reboots the tablet.
"""

